# Generated runtime data / dashboards. captures.jsonl is deliberately TRACKED: it is the forward
# dataset itself (irreplaceable — Polymarket purges prices after resolution) and the daily-capture
# GitHub Action commits it back. dashboard.html is tracked so the Action publishes the readout.
# pilot_trades.jsonl is the pilot's decision ledger — the paper-vs-real record and the weekly-loss
# breaker's memory — equally irreplaceable once the pilot runs, so it is tracked too.
data/*
!data/captures.jsonl
!data/pilot_trades.jsonl
backtest_results/
